# Normalise everything to LF in the repository and in the working copy.
# Keeps diffs free of line-ending churn between Windows and the Ubuntu CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
